{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/Demo_RD_Logo_S_616x100.png?t=1742554865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roulette Dungeon is a turn-based rogue-like where you spin a roulette wheel to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the balance between strategic planning and unpredictable luck by placing bets, using special abilities, and collecting items to outsmart your foes and conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/RD_Gif_Combat.gif?t=1742554865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPIN YOUR WHEEL TO VICTORY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find items to create tons of unique playstyles, collect chips to place your bets &amp; use all of your resources (and a little bit of luck) to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/RD_Gif_Items.gif?t=1742554865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONQUER THE DUNGEON!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique take on the rogue-like genre with a focus on roulette mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place bets to earn more chips or get bonuses in combat &amp; increase your chances of success!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your well earned chips for upgrades, on the slot machine, to play the shell game &amp; more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/RD_Gif_CombatCloseUp.gif?t=1742554865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 playable characters, each with their own abilities &amp; strengths!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">54 different items &amp; countless combinations leading to a vast amount of unique playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first 4 stages of Roulette Dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into endless mode for an increasingly tough challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/RD_Gif_DungeonFloor.gif?t=1742554865\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546280?t=1742554865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546280?t=1742554865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/b76201787736d38687e2dc20c432e95d29f56b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742554865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/b76201787736d38687e2dc20c432e95d29f56b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742554865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/Demo_RD_Logo_S_616x100.png?t=1742554865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roulette Dungeon is a turn-based rogue-like where you spin a roulette wheel to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the balance between strategic planning and unpredictable luck by placing bets, using special abilities, and collecting items to outsmart your foes and conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546280/extras/RD_Gif_Combat.gif?t=1742554865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPIN YOUR WHEEL TO VICTORY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find items to create tons of unique playstyles, collect chips to place your bets &